# Alur pembeli: voucher, quote, pesan, batal, riwayat. Akun: budi.santoso@gmail.com / Password123!
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3030/api/v1
@lat = -6.2433
@lng = 106.7989

### Login pembeli
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "budi.santoso@gmail.com", "password": "Password123!" }

### Ambil listing dari home
# @name home
GET {{baseUrl}}/home?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&tab=human

### Voucher saya
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/vouchers
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Klaim voucher (204; kedua kali 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/vouchers/SISAGUNA10/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Quote (tidak mengubah data). Ganti listing_id/merchant_id kalau perlu.
# @name quote
POST {{baseUrl}}/checkout/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_id": "{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].merchant.id}}",
  "lines": [{ "listing_id": "{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].id}}", "quantity": 2 }],
  "voucher_code": "SISAGUNA10"
}

### Buat pesanan. Idempotency-Key wajib; kirim ulang dengan key yang sama = order yang sama (200).
# @name order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Idempotency-Key: coba-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchant_id": "{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].merchant.id}}",
  "lines": [{ "listing_id": "{{home.response.body.$.data.nearby[0].id}}", "quantity": 2 }],
  "voucher_code": "SISAGUNA10",
  "payment_kind": "cash",
  "note": "Tanpa sambal",
  "expected_total": {{quote.response.body.$.data.total}}
}

### Detail pesanan (pembeli melihat kode pickup)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{order.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Pesanan berjalan / riwayat
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/orders?tab=ongoing
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/orders?tab=history&filter=all&limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}

### Batalkan (hanya saat ready dan sebelum pickup_by)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{order.response.body.$.data.id}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Berubah pikiran" }

### Notifikasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/notifications?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.data.access_token}}
